ccidents must be given","options":{"A":"To Inspector","B":"To police only","C":"To no one","D":"To media"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The Inspector can","options":{"A":"Enter, inspect, examine, inquire","B":"Only observe","C":"Arrest","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The Minimum Wages Act was enacted in","options":{"A":"1948","B":"1947","C":"1950","D":"1936"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Minimum wages are fixed for","options":{"A":"Scheduled employments","B":"All employments","C":"Only factories","D":"Only government"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The Act provides for","options":{"A":"Minimum rates of wages, not fair/living wages","B":"Fair wages","C":"Living wages","D":"Maximum wages"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Minimum wage includes","options":{"A":"Basic + DA (cost of living allowance)","B":"Only basic","C":"Only DA","D":"HRA only"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Wages are revised every","options":{"A":"5 years (or as notified)","B":"1 year","C":"10 years","D":"Never"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The Act applies to","options":{"A":"Whole of India","B":"Only certain states","C":"Only cities","D":"Only villages"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Advisory Boards are constituted under","options":{"A":"Section 7","B":"Section 5","C":"Section 9","D":"Section 11"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Committees for fixation are under","options":{"A":"Section 5","B":"Section 7","C":"Section 9","D":"Section 3"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Overtime under Minimum Wages Act is at","options":{"A":"Double rate","B":"Single rate","C":"1.5 times","D":"No overtime"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Deductions from minimum wages","options":{"A":"Cannot reduce below minimum","B":"Allowed freely","C":"Up to 50%","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The Code on Wages, 2019","options":{"A":"Subsumes Minimum Wages Act","B":"Repeals it without replacement","C":"Keeps it","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Under Code on Wages, minimum wages are","options":{"A":"National floor wage + state minimums","B":"Only central","C":"Only state","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Floor wage is fixed by","options":{"A":"Central Government","B":"State Government","C":"Local body","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Railways follow","options":{"A":"Central minimum wages","B":"State wages","C":"No wages","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Skilled/unskilled categories for minimum wages are","options":{"A":"Fixed by notification","B":"Same for all","C":"Not categorized","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"DA (dearness allowance) under MW Act is linked to","options":{"A":"Cost of Living Index","B":"Fixed","C":"Profit","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Non-payment of minimum wages is","options":{"A":"An offence","B":"Not an offence","C":"Civil only","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Claims under MW Act are heard by","options":{"A":"Authority under Section 20","B":"Labour Court","C":"High Court","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Time limit for claims is","options":{"A":"6 months","B":"1 year","C":"3 years","D":"No limit"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Inspectors under MW Act can","options":{"A":"Enter, examine, seize","B":"Only advise","C":"Arrest","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Penalties: imprisonment up to","options":{"A":"6 months","B":"2 years","C":"1 year","D":"5 years"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The Act covers","options":{"A":"Adults and adolescents","B":"Only adults","C":"Only children","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Wages for two or more classes of work: higher rate applies under","options":{"A":"Section 16","B":"Section 15","C":"Section 17","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Records to be maintained under","options":{"A":"Section 18","B":"Section 17","C":"Section 19","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The employer must display","options":{"A":"Notices of minimum wages","B":"Nothing","C":"Only holidays","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The Payment of Wages Act was enacted in","options":{"A":"1936","B":"1948","C":"1947","D":"1950"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The Act applies to persons drawing wages up to","options":{"A":"Rs.24,000 per month","B":"Rs.10,000","C":"Rs.50,000","D":"No limit"},"answer":"D"},{"q":"Wages must be paid","options":{"A":"Before 7th (if <1000 workers) or 10th of month","B":"Anytime","C":"Yearly","D":"Weekly only"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Wages can be paid in","options":{"A":"Cash, cheque, bank transfer","B":"Only cash","C":"Kind","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Authorized deductions include","options":{"A":"Fines, absence, damage, advances, taxes","B":"Any deduction","C":"No deductions","D":"Only fines"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Total deductions cannot exceed","options":{"A":"50% (75% for cooperative societies)","B":"100%","C":"25%","D":"10%"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Fines cannot exceed","options":{"A":"3% of wages","B":"10%","C":"50%","D":"No limit"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Deduction for absence is","options":{"A":"Proportionate to period of absence","B":"Full wages","C":"Double","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Deduction for damage/loss requires","options":{"A":"Opportunity to show cause","B":"No procedure","C":"Police complaint","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Claims are heard by","options":{"A":"Authority under Section 15","B":"Labour Court","C":"Civil Court","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Time limit for claims is","options":{"A":"12 months","B":"6 months","C":"3 years","D":"No limit"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Appeals lie to","options":{"A":"District Court","B":"High Court","C":"Supreme Court","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The Act does not apply to","options":{"A":"Persons drawing > Rs.24,000","B":"All workers","C":"Government","D":"Railways"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Railway servants are","options":{"A":"Covered (if within wage limit)","B":"Exempt","C":"Partially","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The Payment of Wages (Railways) Rules are","options":{"A":"Separate rules for railways","B":"Same as general","C":"No rules","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Wages include","options":{"A":"Basic, DA, bonus, overtime","B":"Only basic","C":"HRA","D":"None"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"Wages do not include","options":{"A":"Gratuity, PF contribution","B":"Basic","C":"DA","D":"Overtime"},"answer":"A